  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen the protection measures in Manas National Park as a part of the program Indian Rhino Vision 2020 to expand the numbers and range of wild rhinos in Assam, Phase - IX</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to support the salaries of 20 (out of 50) guards (besides the existing staff of the Forest Department) for 12 months, to keep vigil and monitor the rhino habitats of Manas National Park. The remaining 30 guards salaries will be supported by Bodo Territorial Council and National Tiger Conservation Authority.</narrative>
  </description>
